    "title": "Johnstown 7-Eleven Sells Life-Changing Lottery Ticket - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Johnstown\nJohnstown 7-Eleven Sells Life-Changing Lottery Ticket\nBy Matt Sparx,\n4 hours agoI am pretty sure that one of my neighbors is a couple of million dollars richer this week, as someone has hit it big on the Mega Millions lottery. According to 9 News, one lucky lottery player won two million dollars. The ticket was purchased in Northern Colorado, just blocks away from my home in Johnstown.",
